  "processing_chain": "The 2026 release paper states that the distributed files stem from the original master tracks used for CD production rather than consumer-ripped copies. The bound provider changelog records only collection-level ZIP separation in v2 and folder/file renaming in v1. The released files are therefore confirmed PCM from a documented CD-production-master path, but neither the paper, changelog, nor annotations establishes untouched studio/session masters, independent engineers or studios, or disjoint backing personnel.",
